oe=69A424BF"}, "display_name": "SWORD BISTRO VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Ingredients Fly Through the Air, and AI Cooks Them!?**\n\nAll the player has to do is slice the ingredients with a sword. \n\nIt's a super easy rhythm action game!\n\n\n**Slice Ingredients Simultaneously! Freshness Up, Meow!**\n\nIf you slice three ingredients simultaneously with perfect timing, the quality of the dish will improve.\n\n\n**Create One-of-a-Kind Dishes!**\n\nThe final dish varies each time based on the sliced ingredients, making it addictive. An image-generating AI using ChatGPT creates unique dishes.\n\n\n**Share Your Finished Dishes on Social Media!**\n\nIs the completed dish delicious-looking? Or perhaps a bit unusual and mysterious? \n\nPost it on social media and have fun with your friends and followers!\n\n**Would you like to grab a sword and enjoy fantasy cooking with cats?**\n{1216381432717385}\n{815571697349553}\n{870447028275041}", "short_description": "Slice and Dice with Ease! Create Fantasy Dishes with AI.\nSimply chop ingredients to the rhythm, and AI will create fantasy dishes for you."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "12.png", "id": "1720013845495589", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974506_1720013848828922_4513314424170558485_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sZMyGdQp7Y4Q7kNvwGLGou-&_nc_oc=AdkwQ4d0kGIV-5kT-P2Et6KeINrjvNsjMoFHWo38J6iCYoQwNwwATI38d3gkIlBdkWk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsVkxAvlwRWcgHFG2flCu14I590IKrGKIxluC-W74yn-w&oe=69A42C32"}, {"file_name": "8.png", "id": "1313009380118968", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974714_1313009386785634_3991148256327877483_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=k567Tk8L1jgQ7kNvwGwAAPL&_nc_oc=AdltOUWUKQuIj6J2t96AYVtmtHKh6i7pirwlNEbjcrBBCwTBJaDONmNrEU_qRfGoETw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_